		64 gives Rt.rtListNew
		65 gives Rt.rtListLen
		66 gives Rt.rtListContains
		67 gives Rt.rtListElem
		68 gives Rt.rtListPushFront
		69 gives Rt.rtListPushBack
		70 gives Rt.rtListPopFront
